From a237040672169d8c6c77876b35f7aa2f9dc0a5d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Balinder Walia <balinder.walia@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 16:00:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): show per-app ring display_name in the promotion
 pipeline
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Apps can set rings.*.display_name (e.g. "region-a · Manchester") so the
pipeline cards and promote actions name the real deploy target instead of
only the shared Integration/Test labels. target_env is also exposed on
RingView for a secondary cue. Registers wslvault HA regions on the
workstation ConfigMap with those labels.
---
